### 1. Test Server Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Register New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "gmail": "test@example.com",
    "password": "testpass123",
    "password_confirm": "testpass123",
    "first_name": "Test",
    "last_name": "User",
    "is_teacher": true
}

###

### 3. Login User (Save the token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "testpass123"
}

###

### 4. Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 5. Check Username Availability
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/check-username/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "newuser"
}

###

### 6. Create Class Group
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/groups/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "name": "Mathematics 101",
    "description": "Basic Mathematics Course",
    "subject": "Mathematics",
    "is_active": true
}

###

### 7. List Class Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 8. Get Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/dashboard-stats/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 9. Add Student to Class (replace class_group with actual ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/students/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "student_id": "STU001",
    "class_group": 1
}

###

### 10. Create Evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluation/evaluations/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "student": 1,
    "class_group": 1,
    "title": "Math Quiz 1",
    "evaluation_type": "quiz",
    "score": 85,
    "max_score": 100,
    "feedback": "Good work on algebra problems!",
    "evaluation_date": "2024-12-20T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### 11. Get Evaluation Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluation/evaluations/stats/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 12. Test OCR (with image file - update path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluation/ocr/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/test/image.jpg
--boundary--

###

### 13. Create Cheating Detection
POST {{baseUrl}}/cheating-detection/detections/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "class_group": 1,
    "student": 1,
    "input_data": "Student behavior analysis data"
}

###

### 14. Get Cheating Detection Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/cheating-detection/detections/stats/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 15. Export Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/export/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "title": "Class Progress Report",
    "report_type": "class_summary",
    "class_group": 1,
    "include_charts": true,
    "include_detailed_feedback": true
}

###

### 16. Get Report History
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/history/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 17. Search Students
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/search-students/?q=John
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 18. Get Student Progress (replace with actual student ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluation/student-progress/1/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 19. Test Bulk Student Creation
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/groups/1/add_students_bulk/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token {{token}}

{
    "students": [
        {
            "name": "Alice Johnson",
            "email": "alice@example.com",
            "student_id": "STU002"
        },
        {
            "name": "Bob Wilson",
            "email": "bob@example.com",
            "student_id": "STU003"
        }
    ]
}

###

### 20. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###